#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/Scoring.pm:97
#: /opt/webwork/webwork2/lib/WeBWorK/ContentGenerator/Instructor/ScoringDownload.pm:27
msgid ""
"A file name cannot begin with a dot, it cannot be empty, it cannot contain a "
